{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:335f4ffc4f217b16","name":"Seltiss-2 Caravel","source":{"id":"source:reference-335f4ffc4f217b16","title":"Seltiss-2 Caravel","revision":20044,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:05:29Z","sha256":"e248e68b4b14401cd00d749db2cc5e213cf0840e6a9f6dbaceee923024274a0b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20044","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Seltiss-2%20Caravel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-335f4ffc4f217b16","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"}," of means seek to demonstrate their personal successes. This extends to the vessels they buy, and the Seltiss-2 Caravel is a prime example of Huttese taste in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". The Seltiss-2 is modest by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," standards, yet to other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," its amenities seem lush. No two ships are the same, and the interiors are crafted to individual specifications and requirements. Externally, the Seltiss-2 resembles a sail barge. Inside, however, the accommodations- at least for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," and honored guests- are spacious and opulent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Hutt Caravels, the Seltiss-2 among them, are designed with short intrasystem jaunts in mind. Thus, they are not equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," as a standard feature. They move easily between the upper atmosphere of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nal Hutta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nal_Hutta?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and the smuggler's moon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nar Shaddaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nar_Shaddaa","referenceId":"reference:69680e00e40913c9"},". The vessel's combat capabilities are humble and hidden from the naked eye. Any self-respecting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," prefers to keep their weapons concealed to lull enemies into a false sense of superiority.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The main cabin of the Seltiss-2 is equipped with a raised dais and a stunning view. It serves as a Hutt's audience chamber away from the personal palace. The cabin detaches from the rest of the ship, ferrying the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," and their servants to and from the planet below.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Seltiss-2 Caravel Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n"